    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505532</GUID>
      <Text>Frantumatore: Oro</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <GUID>2143505523</GUID>
      <Text>Per favore, fai attenzione a non sporgerti completamente sopra il frantoio!</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <!-- TODO translation -->
      <GUID>2143505552</GUID>
      <Text>This machine doesn't do nuance. It crushes the hardest geodes to extract this precious black sediment. It might not be as sparkling as a diamond, but it’s still incredibly useful in your furnaces and factories.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <!-- TODO translation -->
      <GUID>2143505558</GUID>
      <Text>Beneath its rough stone coating hides an incomparable reddish glow. Your workers will surely complain about the crusher's vibrations.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <!-- TODO translation -->
      <GUID>2143505560</GUID>
      <Text>Smashing, breaking, crushing to pieces... When the debris reveals this metal, essential for brass production. Your rivals will see only rubble; you will see longevity.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <!-- TODO translation -->
      <GUID>2143505561</GUID>
      <Text>Opening a geode is like opening a box of chocolates, with the added risk of getting your fingers caught in a gear. But what a divine surprise when the rock splits to reveal veins of the purest metal! Enough to make your investors' eyes shine...</Text>
    </Text>
